                "排班 " + schedule.scheduleKey() + " 顺延后超出配水窗口，整批拒绝");
    }
    // 与不参与本次顺延的既有占用（当前窗口）冲突检测
    for (ScheduleRow other : occupants) {
        if (affectedIds.contains(other.id())) {
            continue;
        }
        if (newStart < other.endNanos() && other.startNanos() < newEnd) {
